"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","review_id":"-ZVJgHubszn9fgLcL-JTTQ","date":"2019-05-27T16:01:28","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.927635669708252,"text_excerpt":"This restaurant is a gem. Upon entering I was greeted warmly. Seating is open and you can seat yourself outside or inside and enjoyed the music that was playing. After coming across reviews for French Toast it was only right I came and checked it out for myself. Eager to try the French Toast, but also wanting to try my favorite brunch meal I ordered shrimp and grits as well. The shrimp and grits were good, but not my absolute favorite. The added kick was a little too spicy for my liking. The consistency of the grits were ok, but they were definitely flavorful. Smothered pork chops with extra sautéed onions on top of cheese grits = purely delicious. The pork chops were tender and fell righ..."},{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","review_id":"Es-wj7XjTpsekwus7H2Ipw","date":"2018-12-15T21:11:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9182625412940979,"text_excerpt":"We run a guesthouse around the corner, and Cafe Porche is our new favorite brunch spot. Miss Coronella has a menu with ALL HITS and ZERO misses. (And we are halfway through the entire menu.) We HEARD about her grilled veggie poboys, but were fascinated by the catfish and eggs with grits (I LOVE creamy grits) and never had catfish for breakfast but if was delicately battered and perfect. The french toast is also FANTASTIC, and she did a side of grilled cabbage (!!) that was so flavorful I am sure that poboy is terrific. They also do bachelorette brunches. I really don't bother going anywhere else lately."},{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","review_id":"ZvbpGs3237lNu7BvcFRdPQ","date":"2019-10-04T19:31:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9093526601791382,"text_excerpt":"I've been here a few times. My favorite thing is the Carol BeBelle. It's fried grit cakes covered in this cream sauce with shrimp in it. I think you can alter which meat, if any, is in the sauce. It's so good and flavorful. Try it. Trust me Btw the owner is usually there. She always greets you with a smile. Very welcoming atmosphere There's this cute little snoball stand in front that kinda looks like a dollhouse. Unfortunately I've only come for breakfast, so I've never had the opportunity to try one."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","photo_id":"NwZOBci6VnogdfqXkUkRvg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/NwZOBci6VnogdfqXkUkRvg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8424916863441467},{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","photo_id":"AmQUzM_oOydcBU3qgewkbg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AmQUzM_oOydcBU3qgewkbg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8366023302078247},{"business_id":"rbPK4jSyFS10zhWYvo_Srg","photo_id":"OTD_Rdd05_T401sGUJYeGw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/OT